132	     * so the region cannot drift from the identity every other derived value flows through. Owners
133	     * with no {@code customerCode} fall back to resolving the region directly. Both the parse and
134	     * the fallback (including the {@code UNKNOWN} sentinel) live in {@code OwnerCustomerCode}.
